  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518640467707-6811f4a6ab73?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "overview": "Nezuko is the most accessible Demon character and the strategic bridge between swordsman and demon playstyles. Her Blood Demon Art (Exploding Blood) places persistent fire zones that deal continuous DoT (5 HP/second) to opponents in contact. Unlike swordsmen, Nezuko cannot use Breathing Recovery (natural HP regeneration) but gains HP from landing hits. Her awakened form (Ultimate) amplifies all fire zones and grants her a 10-second speed boost, making her temporarily competitive with swordsmen in close range. Optimal Nezuko play baits opponents into her fire zones while maintaining mid-range distance.",
  "overviewJa": "禰豆子は最も親しみやすい鬼キャラクターで、剣士と鬼プレイスタイルの戦略的な橋渡し。血鬼術（爆血）は接触中の相手に継続DoT（毎秒5HP）を与える持続炎ゾーンを設置。剣士と異なり禰豆子は呼吸による回復（自然HP再生）を使えないが、ヒットからHPを獲得する。覚醒形態（奥義）は全炎ゾーンを強化し10秒の速度上昇を付与し、一時的に近距離剣士と競争できる。最適な禰豆子プレイは中距離を維持しながら相手を炎ゾーンに誘い込む。",
